---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Contact fibub with tool ideas, bug reports or privacy questions.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lead">Have an idea for a tool, found a bug, or have a privacy question? Email <a href="mailto:hello@fibub.com">hello@fibub.com</a>.</p>
    <p><b>Suggestions and bug reports are very welcome.</b> Tell us which tool, what you expected and what happened. If we build your idea, we would love to thank you on our credits page; just say how you would like to be named, or that you would rather not be.</p>
    <p>Please never send us the private file you were working on. If something went wrong, tell us the tool, the type and rough size of the file, and your device and browser. That is usually enough to find the problem.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
